{"id":"c412569a8bba638b","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-tape.md","title":"Turing Machine Tape","display":"df-tm-tape — Turing Machine Tape","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-tape","aliases":["88-df-tm-tape"],"display":"df-tm-tape — Turing Machine Tape","depends_on":["[[88-df-alphabet]]","[[88-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-tape"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-tape</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-tape — Turing Machine Tape"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ac75150a2814e24\" href=\"?note=1ac75150a2814e24\" title=\"88-df-alphabet\">88-df-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,B,T\">\\(\\Gamma,B,T\\)</span> (candidate tape alphabet, blank, and tape)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma,B}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma,B}(T)\\)</span> (tape predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}tape}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma,B}(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land B\\in\\Gamma\n\\land T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\n\\land\\bigl|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\neq B\\}\\bigr|&lt;\\aleph_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}tape}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma,B}(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land B\\in\\Gamma\n\\land T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\n\\land\\bigl|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\neq B\\}\\bigr|&lt;\\aleph_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>纸带是双向无限的符号序列</li>\n<li>纸带两端都只有有限个非空符号</li>\n<li>纸带是Turing机的存储介质</li>\n<li>有限支撑条件与原来的“存在左右界”在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>上等价，但直接表达了\n配置只能含有限非空信息；这使配置可有限编码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"1ac75150a2814e24","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-cardinality]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma,B,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma,B}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}tape}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma,B}(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\n\\land B\\in\\Gamma\n\\land T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\n\\land\\bigl|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\neq B\\}\\bigr|<\\aleph_0","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false}],"bytes":927,"backlinks":[{"id":"fb6aa5db0f2eb060","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)$ (finite-support tape, see [[88-df-tm-tape]])"},{"id":"516b366e7e239944","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma,B}(T)$ (tape, see [[88-df-tm-tape]])"},{"id":"3f8f3a8be6b88d18","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)$ (finite-support tape,